+# Solution
+
+`redact` uses a compiled, case-insensitive regular expression to replace API-key tokens having the `key-`, `sk-`, or `tok_` prefix and at least 12 alphanumeric characters. It processes the input line by line with line endings retained, passing through lines whose first token starts with `DEBUG_` and preserving all other text exactly.
+
+The README's statement that masking is "unconditional across the entire input" is inconsistent with the later `DEBUG_` exemption. The implementation treats the more specific operational exception as overriding that general statement; this exception is also a security-sensitive assumption if those lines can ever leave the internal network.
